     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once you PUT that CSV file you end up with an RDFSource Container that has no unique properties, and a bunch of odd (not even accessible) resources in \".well-known/genid\".  And the following registered namespaces:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
